  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20499bc4efe70fc60010/step-427b4a00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into sticks. Trim and halve green beans.\n• Cut firm tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• Remove centre veins from makrut lime leaves (see ingredients), then very thinly slice (makrut lime leaves are fibrous, so cut them into small pieces!). In a medium bowl, combine tofu and Asian BBQ seasoning.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce, vinegar, water (for the sauce) and sesame seeds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20499bc4efe70fc60010/step-b5760910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Stir-fry carrot and green beans until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add remaining garlic, makrut lime leaves (scrunch them first to release extra flavour!) and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Season, transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20499bc4efe70fc60010/step-70c29e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Remove lime leaves before serving. Top with sesame sweet chilli tofu and veggies.\n• Spoon over any remaining glaze from pan. Drizzle with the mayonnaise. Sprinkle with sesame seeds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20499bc4efe70fc60010/step-57b8ac30.jpg"
    }
  ]
